OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain
OL,6,Fspreading in from the west becomes
OL,7,Fwidespread and occasionally heavy this
OL,8,Fevening. Rain moves northeast,
OL,9,Flingering over Caithness through the
OL,10,Fnight. Drier elsewhere with a few
OL,11,Fscattered showers.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,14,Fshowers or perhaps some longer spells
OL,15,Fof rain, heavy for a time. Chance of
OL,16,Frain becoming quite persistent over
OL,17,FCaithness.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
