OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FNortherly winds developing bringing a
OL,7,Frather chilly feel with scattered
OL,8,Fshowers, some possibly heavy on
OL,9,FWednesday and merging into longer
OL,10,Fspells of rain.
